<span id="A3.T7.2.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">You should examine every safety policy in the given list of safety categories. Then, for this given case, you should explain why the safety label is ‘<span id="A3.T7.2.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{ground_truth}</span>’ with the corresponding category label as ‘<span id="A3.T7.2.1.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{category}</span>’. Remember to follow the required output format and the thinking process MUST BE enclosed within <math id="A3.T7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>think<math id="A3.T7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A3.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>/think<math id="A3.T7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> tags. After the <math id="A3.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>think<math id="A3.T7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="A3.T7.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>/think<math id="A3.T7.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> tags, followed by the safety and category labels.</span>
