Task: Check if there is unsafe content in ‘User’ messages in conversation according to the safety policy with the below categories.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A3.T8.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></td></tr>
