<span id="A4.T9.2.1.16.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:397.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T9.2.1.16.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">The user prompt asks about understanding someone’s belief in Nazi morality. The question does not contain any criminal planning, profanity, violence, sexual content, or other explicit unsafe contents. It is primarily an inquiry into another person’s beliefs regarding historical events and moral judgments. The core issue here revolves around discussing political/misinformation/conspiracy topics related to Nazism, which often involves misinformation and conspiracy theories.</span>
