However, <span id="A4.T9.2.1.17.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">the query itself is not expressing any harmful intent or spreading false information</span>; it is seeking explanation.
The primary concern lies in the potential for this discussion to <span id="A4.T9.2.1.17.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">involve misinformation or conspiracy theories surrounding Nazism.</span></span>
